            "value" : "Android的核心結束了Andarium。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android’s kernel panicked" : {
      "comment" : "Title of Home's card after Android's kernel panicked, the Linux kernel's own fatal error.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Androidのカーネルパニック"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android内核发生严重错误"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android核心發生嚴重錯誤"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android’s memory could not be restored, so it starts again from boot." : {
      "comment" : "Home's card after a start that could not bring back the memory Android saved when it was paused.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Androidのメモリを復元できなかったため、起動からやり直します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法恢复Android的内存，因此将从启动开始重新运行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無法回復Android的記憶體，因此會從開機重新開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "arm64, %lld KiB pages" : {
      "comment" : "The architecture row of the Info sheet: the CPU architecture, then the size of a memory page, as in arm64, 4 KiB pages.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "arm64、%lld KiBページ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "arm64、%lld KiB页面"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "arm64、%lld KiB頁面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dismiss" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "閉じる"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "關閉"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found in Settings while the virtual machine runs" : {
      "comment" : "Where a feature is found: in the Settings sheet that opens while the virtual machine runs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仮想マシンの実行中は“設定”にあります"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机运行时，可在“设置”中找到"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虛擬機器執行時，可在「設定」中找到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frame rate lowered while this device is hot" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "デバイスが高温のため、フレームレートを下げています"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设备温度较高，已降低帧速率"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "裝置溫度較高，已降低影格速率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If an app looks broken, swipe it away in Recents and open it again." : {
      "comment" : "Recents is Android's list of recent apps inside the virtual machine; use the virtual machine's own name for it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリの表示がおかしい場合は、“最近使用したアプリ”でそのアプリを上にスワイプして終了し、もう一度開いてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果应用显示异常，请在“最近使用的应用”中将其划掉，然后重新打开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果應用程式顯示異常，請在「最近使用的應用程式」中將其滑掉，然後重新開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS ended Andarium" : {
      "comment" : "Title of Home's card after iOS ended Andarium because the memory it used came near the limit.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOSがAndariumを終了しました"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS结束了Andarium"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS結束了Andarium"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS is likely to close Andarium above %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@を超えると、iOSによってAndariumが終了される可能性が高くなります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "超过%@时，iOS很可能会关闭Andarium。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "超過%@時，iOS很可能會關閉Andarium。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS is likely to close Andarium with %@ of virtual machine memory on this %@. %@ or less is safer. Lower it with Edit under Virtual machine." : {
      "comment" : "Arguments: virtual machine memory, device name, the safer size. Edit and Virtual machine are labels on Home.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この%2$@で仮想マシンのメモリが%1$@の場合、iOSによってAndariumが終了される可能性が高くなります。%3$@以下にする方が安全です。“仮想マシン”の“編集”で下げてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此%2$@上的虚拟机内存为%1$@时，iOS很可能会关闭Andarium。%3$@或更低更为安全。请使用“虚拟机”下的“编辑”降低内存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此%2$@上的虛擬機器記憶體為%1$@時，iOS很可能會關閉Andarium。%3$@或更低更為安全。請使用「虛擬機器」下的「編輯」降低記憶體。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "it could not start (%@)" : {
      "comment" : "A clause of the line the end screen offers to copy, after \"Virtual machine ended:\". %@ is the reason, in English.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "起動できませんでした（%@）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法启动（%@）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無法啟動（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "it could not start (this device could not give it %@ of memory)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "起動できませんでした（このデバイスは%@のメモリを割り当てられませんでした）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法启动（此设备无法提供%@内存）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無法啟動（此裝置無法提供%@記憶體）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "it was stopped from the boot screen" : {
      "comment" : "A clause of the line the end screen offers to copy, after \"Virtual machine ended:\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "起動画面から停止されました"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
